  "description": "WP-08 has no entries in 07_EVENT_CATALOGUE.yaml -- events derived directly from app/modules/ddcp/coated_device_commands.py's actual event_type= producer code. 11 events found: CoatedDeviceProfileDraftCreated, DrugCoatingUsageRecorded, CoatingRunStarted, COATING_PARAMETER_EXCURSION, CoatingEvidenceRecorded (mutually exclusive outcomes of the same in-process-parameter call site), DRUG_LOADING_OOS, DrugLoadingRecorded (mutually exclusive outcomes of the same drug-loading call site), CoatedDeviceFunctionalTestRecorded, CoatedDeviceDispositioned, CoatedDeviceGenealogyBound, CoatingRunCompleted, PostSterilizationTestRecorded, CoatedDeviceBatchPackageGenerated. Note: 6 of this module's real events across the 4 DDCP files use SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE (INJECTOR_TEST_FAILED, DOSE_DELIVERY_FAILED, COATING_PARAMETER_EXCURSION, DRUG_LOADING_OOS, CLOSURE_TEST_FAILED, INHALER_QC_OOS) instead of this codebase's otherwise-universal PascalCase event naming convention -- a minor, low-severity inconsistency, included here factually rather than silently renamed to fit the convention.",
  "x-requirement-ids": [
    "COAT-FR-001",
    "COAT-FR-002",
    "COAT-FR-005",
    "COAT-FR-006",
    "COAT-FR-008",
